type look
version 1
---
# Holdout's look (og-taste §12), named by project.ogt and GameDesc.look:
# the catalogue's faceted-low-poly preset (flat facets on every lit
# material, AgX tone mapping) over the KayKit outpost, with the scifi UI
# style (flat near-black glass, one ice-blue accent, mono telemetry) for a
# shooter's HUD. src/world.ts lights the arena at dusk; a look written
# below wins field by field (og new writes its own from --look).
name "Holdout"
extends "faceted-low-poly"
ui "styles/scifi/style.ogt"
